"<strong>Datoformat</strong>, som findes under <strong>WordPress-"
"indstillinger &gt; Generelt</strong>."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21241
#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21312
#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21353
msgid "Custom Date"
msgstr "Brugerdefineret dato"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21248
