msgstr ""
"Returnerer bloggens dato og klokkeslæt i det angivne format (PHP-datoformat)."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21256
#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21326
#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21369
msgid "Current Date"
msgstr "Dags dato"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21258
msgid ""
"Returns the blog time formatted according to the <strong>Time Format</"
"strong> setting found in <strong>WordPress Settings &gt; General</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Returnerer blogtiden formateret i henhold til indstillingen "
"<strong>Tidsformat</strong>, som findes under <strong>WordPress-"
"indstillinger &gt; Generelt</strong>."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21269
msgid "Client"
msgstr "Kunde"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21276
msgid "Language (Browser)"
msgstr "Sprog (browser)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21277
msgid ""
"Language tag from the visitor's browser <code>navigator.language</code> (RFC "
"5646; ISO 639 with optional ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 region; hyphen-separated; for "
"example <code>en-US</code>). Client-side only; empty when parsed on the "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Sprog-tag fra den besøgendes browser <code>navigator.language</code> (RFC "
"5646; ISO 639 med valgfri ISO 3166-1 alpha-2-region; bindestregsadskilt; "
"f.eks. <code>en-US</code>). Kun på klientsiden; tomt når det parses på "
"serveren."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21283
msgid "Locale (Browser)"
msgstr "Landestandard (browser)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21284
msgid ""
"POSIX-style locale derived from the browser tag: underscores instead of "
"hyphens (WordPress/POSIX-style; for example <code>en_US</code>). Region uses "
"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 when present. Client-side only; empty when parsed on the "
"server."
msgstr ""
"POSIX-lignende locale afledt af browser-tagget: understreger i stedet for "
"bindestreger (WordPress-/POSIX-stil; f.eks. <code>en_US</code>). Regionen "
"bruger ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 når den er til stede. Kun på klientsiden; tomt når "
