msgstr "Returnerer den sætningsformede version af en indtastet streng."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22543
msgid "Apply wpautop to a string"
msgstr "Anvend wpautop på en streng"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22548
msgid "Returns the string with wpautop applied to it."
msgstr "Returnerer strengen med wpautop anvendt på den."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22555
msgid "Trim a string"
msgstr "Trim en streng"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22560
msgid "Returns the trimmed string."
msgstr "Returnerer den trimmede streng."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22567
msgid "Convert a string to a slug"
msgstr "Konvertér en streng til en slug"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22572
msgid "Returns the string as a slug suitable for URLs."
msgstr "Returnerer strengen som en slug, der er egnet til URL'er."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22579
msgid "Return the name prefix "
msgstr "Returnér navnepræfikset "

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22584
msgid "Returns the prefix from a full name."
msgstr "Returnerer præfikset fra et fuldt navn."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22591
msgid "Return the first name "
msgstr "Returnér fornavnet "

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22596
msgid "Returns the first name from a full name."
msgstr "Returnerer fornavnet fra et fuldt navn."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22603
msgid "Return the middle name "
msgstr "Returnér mellemnavnet "

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22608
msgid "Returns the middle name from a full name."
msgstr "Returnerer mellemnavnet fra et fuldt navn."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22615
msgid "Return the last name "
msgstr "Returnér efternavnet "

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22620
msgid "Returns the last name from a full name."
msgstr "Returnerer efternavnet fra et fuldt navn."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22627
msgid "Return the name suffix"
msgstr "Returnér navnesuffikset"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22632
msgid "Returns the suffix from a full name."
msgstr "Returnerer suffikset fra et fuldt navn."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22650
msgid "MD5"
msgstr "MD5"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22655
msgid "Returns the MD5 hash of the input string. Server-side only."
msgstr "Returnerer MD5-hashen af inputstrengen. Kun på serversiden."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22661
msgid "SHA-256"
msgstr "SHA-256"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22666
msgid "Returns the SHA-256 hash of the input string. Server-side only."
msgstr "Returnerer SHA-256-hashen af inputstrengen. Kun på serversiden."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22683
#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-admin.php:775
msgid "Field Label"
msgstr "Felt label"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22688
msgid "Returns the field label by ID."
msgstr "Returnerer feltetiketten efter ID."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22695
msgid "Field Value as Floating Point Number"
msgstr "Feltets værdi som et flydende punkttal"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22700
msgid ""
"Use this variable to insert the value of a field on your form as a floating "
"point number. For example: <code>#field(123)</code> where '123' is the field "
"ID shown in the layout editor. This can be used to convert prices to "
"floating point numbers. An example output might be: 123.45"
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at indsætte værdien af et felt i din formular som et "
"flydende tal. For eksempel: <code>#field(123)</code>, hvor \"123\" er det "
"felt-id, der vises i layout-editoren. Dette kan bruges til at konvertere "
"priser til flydende punkttal. Et eksempel på et output kunne være: 123.45"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22707
msgid "Field Date Age"
msgstr "Feltets datoalder"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22713
msgid ""
"Return the age of the provided date field. Period: y = Years (Default), m = "
"Months, d = Days, h = Hours, n = Minutes, s = Seconds"
msgstr ""
"Returner alderen for det angivne datofelt. Periode: y = år (standard), m = "
"måneder, d = dage, h = timer, n = minutter, s = sekunder"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22720
msgid "Field Date Formatted"
msgstr "Felt dato formateret"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22726
msgid "Return a field formatted according to the PHP date function."
msgstr "Returner et felt formateret i henhold til PHP's date-funktion."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22733
msgid "Field Date Adjusted by Offset in Seconds"
msgstr "Felt Dato justeret med forskydning i sekunder"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22740
msgid "Return a date adjusted by an offset in seconds."
msgstr "Returnerer en dato justeret med en forskydning i sekunder."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22747
msgid "Count the Number of Words in a Field"
msgstr "Tæl antallet af ord i et felt"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22753
msgid ""
"Use this variable to insert the number of words in a field on your form. For "
"example: <code>#calc(#field_count_word(123))</code> where '123' is the field "
"ID shown in the layout editor. Optionally specify a JavaScript regex to "
"filter the characters included in the calculation."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at indsætte antallet af ord i et felt på din "
"formular. For eksempel: <code>#calc(#field_count_word(123))</code> hvor "
"'123' er felt-ID'et, der vises i layouteditoren. Angiv eventuelt en "
"JavaScript-regex til at filtrere de tegn, der medtages i beregningen."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22760
msgid "Count the Number of Characters in a Field"
msgstr "Tæl antallet af tegn i et felt"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22766
msgid ""
"Use this variable to insert the number of characters in a field on your "
"form. For example: <code>#calc(#field_count_char(123))</code> where '123' is "
"the field ID shown in the layout editor. Optionally specify a JavaScript "
"regex to filter the characters included in the calculation. For example: "
"<code>#calc(#field_count_char(123, \"/[^0-9a-z]/gi\"))</code>."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at indsætte antallet af tegn i et felt på din "
"formular. For eksempel: <code>#calc(#field_count_char(123))</code> hvor "
"'123' er felt-ID'et, der vises i layouteditoren. Angiv eventuelt en "
"JavaScript-regex til at filtrere de tegn, der medtages i beregningen. For "
"eksempel: <code>#calc(#field_count_char(123, \"/[^0-9a-z]/gi\"))</code>."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22773
msgid "Field ID with Min Value"
msgstr "Felt-id med min. værdi"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22778
msgid ""
"Use this variable to return the ID of the field containing lowest value. For "
"example: <code>#calc(#field_min_id(5, 6, 7, 8))</code>. This would check "
"fields IDs 5, 6, 7, and 8 and return the field ID containing the lowest "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at returnere ID'et for det felt, der indeholder den "
"laveste værdi. For eksempel: <code>#calc(#field_min_id(5, 6, 7, 8))</code>. "
"Dette vil kontrollere felt-ID'erne 5, 6, 7 og 8 og returnere det felt-ID, "
"der indeholder den laveste værdi."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22785
msgid "Field ID with Max Value"
msgstr "Felt-id med maks. værdi"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22790
msgid ""
"Use this variable to return the ID of the field containing highest value. "
"For example: <code>#calc(#field_max_id(5, 6, 7, 8))</code>. This would check "
"fields IDs 5, 6, 7, and 8 and return the field ID containing the highest "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at returnere ID'et for det felt, der indeholder den "
"højeste værdi. For eksempel: <code>#calc(#field_max_id(5, 6, 7, 8))</code>. "
"Dette vil kontrollere felt-ID'erne 5, 6, 7 og 8 og returnere det felt-ID, "
"der indeholder den højeste værdi."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22797
msgid "Minimum Value of Fields"
msgstr "Minimumværdi for felter"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22802
msgid ""
"Use this variable to return the minimum value for the supplied field IDs. "
"For example: <code>#calc(#field_min_value(5, 6, 7, 8))</code>. This would "
"check fields IDs 5, 6, 7, and 8 and return the lowest value contained within "
"those fields."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at returnere minimumsværdien for de angivne felt-"
"ID'er. For eksempel: <code>#calc(#field_min_value(5, 6, 7, 8))</code>. Dette "
"vil kontrollere felt-ID'erne 5, 6, 7 og 8 og returnere den laveste værdi, "
"der findes i disse felter."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22809
msgid "Maximum Value of Fields"
msgstr "Maksimumværdi for felter"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22814
msgid ""
"Use this variable to return the highest value for the supplied field IDs. "
"For example: <code>#calc(#field_max_value(5, 6, 7, 8))</code>. This would "
"check fields IDs 5, 6, 7, and 8 and return the highest value contained "
"within those fields."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at returnere den højeste værdi for de angivne felt-"
"ID'er. For eksempel: <code>#calc(#field_max_value(5, 6, 7, 8))</code>. Dette "
"vil kontrollere felt-ID'erne 5, 6, 7 og 8 og returnere den højeste værdi, "
"der findes i disse felter."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22821
msgid "Field Label with Min Value"
msgstr "Feltetiket med min. værdi"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22826
msgid ""
"Use this variable to return the label of the field containing lowest value. "
"For example: <code>#calc(#field_min_id(5, 6, 7, 8))</code>. This would check "
"fields IDs 5, 6, 7, and 8 and return the field label containing the lowest "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at returnere etiketten for det felt, der indeholder "
"den laveste værdi. For eksempel: <code>#calc(#field_min_id(5, 6, 7, 8))</"
"code>. Dette vil kontrollere felterne med ID'erne 5, 6, 7 og 8 og returnere "
"feltetiketten for det felt, der indeholder den laveste værdi."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22833
msgid "Field Label with Max Value"
msgstr "Feltetiket med maks. værdi"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22838
msgid ""
"Use this variable to return the label of the field containing highest value. "
"For example: <code>#calc(#field_max_id(5, 6, 7, 8))</code>. This would check "
"fields IDs 5, 6, 7, and 8 and return the field label containing the highest "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at returnere etiketten for det felt, der indeholder "
"den højeste værdi. For eksempel: <code>#calc(#field_max_id(5, 6, 7, 8))</"
"code>. Dette vil kontrollere felt-ID'erne 5, 6, 7 og 8 og returnere den "
"feltetiket, der indeholder den højeste værdi."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22845
msgid "Field Value"
msgstr "Feltværdi"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22852
msgid ""
"Use this variable to insert the value of a field on your form. For example: "
"<code>#field(123)</code> where '123' is the field ID shown in the layout "
"editor. If delimiter specified, fields with multiple values (e.g. "
"checkboxes) will be separated by the specified delimiter. If column is "
"specified it will return the value found in that data grid column. The value "
"of column can be the column label or index (starting with 0)."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at indsætte værdien af et felt i din formular. For "
"eksempel: # <code>Felt(123)</code>, hvor \"123\" er feltets ID, der vises i "
"layouteditoren. Hvis der er angivet en afgrænser, vil felter med flere "
"værdier (f.eks. afkrydsningsfelter) blive adskilt med den angivne afgrænser. "
"Hvis kolonne er angivet, returneres den værdi, der findes i den pågældende "
"kolonne i datagitteret. Værdien af kolonne kan være kolonnebetegnelsen eller "
"indekset (startende med 0)."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22862
msgid "Data Grid Rows"
msgstr "Rækker i datagitteret"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22868
msgid "Value Column"
msgstr "Værdikolonne"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22869
msgid ""
"Use this variable within a data grid row to insert the text found in the "
"value column."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel i en datagitterrække til at indsætte den tekst, der "
"findes i værdikolonnen."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22876
msgid "Label Column"
msgstr "Kolonne med etiket"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22877
msgid ""
"Use this variable within a data grid row to insert the text found in the "
"label column."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel i en datagitterrække til at indsætte den tekst, der "
"findes i kolonnen med etiketter."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22884
msgid "Action Variable Column"
msgstr "Kolonne med handlingsvariabel"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22885
msgid ""
"Use this variable within a data grid row to insert the text found in the "
"action variable column."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel i en række i et datagitter til at indsætte den tekst, "
"der findes i kolonnen med handlingsvariable."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22892
msgid "Price Column"
msgstr "Pris kolonne"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22893
msgid ""
"Use this variable within a data grid row to insert the text found in the "
"price column."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel i en datagitterrække til at indsætte den tekst, der "
"findes i priskolonnen."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22900
msgid "Price Column (With Currency)"
msgstr "Priskolonne (med valuta)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22901
msgid ""
"Use this variable within a data grid row to insert the text found in the "
"price column formatted using the currency settings."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel i en datagitterrække til at indsætte den tekst, der "
"findes i priskolonnen, formateret med valutaindstillingerne."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22908
msgid "WooCommerce Cart Column"
msgstr "WooCommerce kurv kolonne"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22909
msgid ""
"Use this variable within a data grid row to insert the text found in the "
"WooCommerce cart column."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel i en datagitterrække til at indsætte den tekst, der "
"findes i WooCommerce-kolonnen for indkøbskurven."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22925
msgid "Select Total Count"
msgstr "Samlet antal valgte"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22930
msgid ""
"Use this variable to return the total number of options in a select field. "
"For example: <code>#select_count_total(123)</code> where '123' is the field "
"ID shown in the layout editor. Use <code>#text(#select_count_total(123))</"
"code> to keep the value dynamically updated."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at returnere det samlede antal valgmuligheder i et "
"valg-felt. For eksempel: <code>#select_count_total(123)</code> hvor '123' er "
"felt-ID'et, der vises i layouteditoren. Brug "
"<code>#text(#select_count_total(123))</code> for at holde værdien dynamisk "
"opdateret."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22938
msgid "Select Count"
msgstr "Antal valgte"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22943
msgid ""
"Use this variable to return the number of options that have been selected in "
"a select field. For example: <code>#select_count(123)</code> where '123' is "
"the field ID shown in the layout editor. Use "
"<code>#text(#select_count(123))</code> to keep the value dynamically updated."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at returnere antallet af valgmuligheder, der er "
"valgt i et valgfelt. For eksempel: <code>#select_count(123)</code> hvor "
"'123' er felt-ID'et, der vises i layouteditoren. Brug "
"<code>#text(#select_count(123))</code> for at holde værdien dynamisk "
"opdateret."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22951
msgid "Select Option Text"
msgstr "Vælg valgmulighedstekst"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22957
msgid ""
"Use this variable to insert the selected option text of a select field on "
"your form. For example: <code>#select_option_text(123)</code> where '123' is "
"the field ID shown in the layout editor."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at indsætte den valgte valgmulighedstekst i et "
"valgfelt på din formular. For eksempel: <code>#select_option_text(123)</"
"code>, hvor \"123\" er det felt-id, der vises i layout-editoren."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22974
msgid "Checkbox Rows Count"
msgstr "Antal afkrydsningsfelt-rækker"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22980
msgid ""
"Use this variable to return the total number of checkboxes in a checkbox or "
"price checkbox field. For example: <code>#checkbox_count_total(123)</code> "
"where '123' is the field ID shown in the layout editor. Use "
"<code>#text(#checkbox_count_total(123))</code> to keep the value dynamically "
"updated. Set <code>include_hidden</code> attribute to <code>true</code> to "
"include hidden checkboxes."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at returnere det samlede antal afkrydsningsfelter i "
"et afkrydsningsfelt eller et pris-afkrydsningsfelt. For eksempel: "
"<code>#checkbox_count_total(123)</code> hvor '123' er felt-ID'et, der vises "
"i layouteditoren. Brug <code>#text(#checkbox_count_total(123))</code> for at "
"holde værdien dynamisk opdateret. Sæt attributten <code>include_hidden</"
"code> til <code>true</code> for at inkludere skjulte afkrydsningsfelter."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22988
msgid "Checkbox Checked Count"
msgstr "Antal markerede afkrydsningsfelter"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:22994
msgid ""
"Use this variable to return the number of checkboxes that have been checked "
"in a checkbox or price checkbox field. For example: "
"<code>#checkbox_count(123)</code> where '123' is the field ID shown in the "
"layout editor. Use <code>#text(#checkbox_count(123))</code> to keep the "
"value dynamically updated."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at returnere antallet af afkrydsningsfelter, der er "
"markeret i et afkrydsningsfelt eller et pris-afkrydsningsfelt. For eksempel: "
"<code>#checkbox_count(123)</code> hvor '123' er felt-ID'et, der vises i "
"layouteditoren. Brug <code>#text(#checkbox_count(123))</code> for at holde "
"værdien dynamisk opdateret."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:23002
msgid "Checkbox Label"
msgstr "Etiket til afkrydsningsfelt"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:23008
msgid ""
"Use this variable to insert the label of a checkbox field on your form. For "
"example: <code>#checkbox_label(123)</code> where '123' is the field ID shown "
"in the layout editor."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at indsætte etiketten for et afkrydsningsfelt i din "
"formular. For eksempel: eksempel: <code>#checkbox_label(123)</code>, hvor "
"\"123\" er feltets ID, der vises i layouteditoren."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:23025
msgid "Radio Label"
msgstr "Radiomærke"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:23030
msgid ""
"Use this variable to insert the label of a radio field on your form. For "
"example: <code>#radio_label(123)</code> where '123' is the field ID shown in "
"the layout editor."
msgstr ""
"Brug denne variabel til at indsætte etiketten for et radiofelt på din "
"formular. For eksempel: for eksempel: <code>#radio_label(123)</code>, hvor "
"\"123\" er det felt-id, der vises i layout-editoren."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:23048
msgid "Returns the email subject line."
msgstr "Returnerer emnelinjen for e-mailen."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:23056
msgid "Content type"
msgstr "Indholdstype"

